&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>This Deepawali we clean the house, light lamps, give gifts, and meet the people we love. These acts follow custom. Custom is one kind of law. It has a place. The day also lets us see a difference that is easy to miss. The difference is between living by laws and living by dharma.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Happy Deepawali 2019</title><link>https://dasarpai.github.io/wiaposts/happy-deepawali-2019/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Jun 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hari@dasarpai.com (Dr. Hari Thapliyaal)</author><guid>https://dasarpai.github.io/wiaposts/happy-deepawali-2019/</guid><description>&lt;p>
